{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"CLSA-2023-1675984487","published":"2023-02-09T23:14:47Z","modified":"2026-06-01T00:33:20.338041001Z","summary":"Update of tzdata","details":"- Upgrade to tzdata-2022g\n  - The northern edge of the Mexican state of Chihuahua will\n    change time zone to agree with nearby US locations on\n    2022-11-30.\n  - Added a new Zone America/Ciudad_Juarez that splits from\n    America/Ojinaga.\n  - Mexico will stop observing DST except near the US border.\n  - Chihuahua moved to -06 year round starting on 2022-10-30.\n  - Fiji no longer observes DST.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"tzdata","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.4","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/tzdata?distro=centos-8.4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2022g-1.el8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.4els/CLSA-2023-1675984487.json"}},{"package":{"name":"tzdata-java","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.4","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/tzdata-java?distro=centos-8.4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2022g-1.el8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.4els/CLSA-2023-1675984487.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.cloudlinux.com/centos8.4-els/CLSA-2023-1675984487.html"}]}